      </header>
      <main>
        <section class="intro" aria-label="Geneva, brick by brick">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> SMALL BRICKS. BIG WONDERS.</div>
          <h1>Geneva,<br>brick by <span>brick.</span></h1>
          <p>작은 블록으로 만나는, 조금 특별한 제네바.</p>
          <div class="intro-meta"><span class="mini-spark">✳</span> 6 iconic places <span class="meta-dot">·</span> One little adventure</div>
        </section>
        <div class="edition"><span>THE SWISS COLLECTION</span><strong>No. 001 <i>—</i> Genève</strong><span class="edition-coordinate">46°12′ N &nbsp; 6°09′ E</span></div>
        <div id="scene" aria-label="레고 블록으로 만든 제네바 3D 모션그래픽"></div>
        <div id="labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>
